<title>BELGIUM: EU to reject French textiles aid scheme-EU source.</title>
<headline>EU to reject French textiles aid scheme-EU source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission is set to reject on Wednesday a French state aid scheme used to stem job losses in the textiles sector, a European Union source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We will take the final negative decision,&quot; he told Reuters.</p>
</text>
